    <div class="gc-icon">📖</div>
    <div class="gc-text">
      <div class="gc-year">~1440</div>
      <div class="gc-title">The Gutenberg Revolution</div>
      <div class="gc-desc">Johannes Gutenberg's movable-type press transformed book production from a monastic craft to an industrial process. Within 50 years, print shops appeared across Western Europe. Prices collapsed; literacy soared. It is the single most transformative event in the history of written knowledge.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="gc-stats">
      <div class="gc-stat">
        <div class="v">×1000s</div>
        <div class="l">Output multiplier post-1440</div>
      </div>
      <div class="gc-stat">
        <div class="v">↓ 80%</div>
        <div class="l">Cost drop per book (est.)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="gc-stat">
        <div class="v">50 yrs</div>
        <div class="l">To spread across Europe</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

